#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-resource-estimation.rst:2
msgid "H2 Resource Estimation"
msgstr "H2 资源估计"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-resource-estimation.rst:4
msgid ""
"This tutorial estimates EFTQC hardware resources for H2 with ``q2m3.core.resource_estimation``. "
"It compares vacuum and MM-embedded Hamiltonians."
msgstr "本教程使用 ``q2m3.core.resource_estimation`` 估计 H2 的 EFTQC 硬件资源，比较真空和 MM 嵌入哈密顿量。"

