#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-resource-estimation.rst:64
msgid ""
"MM embedding is expected to change the resource estimate only slightly. Point charges mainly "
"change one-electron terms. For this small H2 example, two-electron integrals dominate the "
"resource estimate."
msgstr "MM 嵌入预计只会略微改变资源估计。点电荷主要改变单电子项。在这个小规模 H2 示例中，双电子积分主导资源估计。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-resource-estimation.rst:69
msgid "Interpretation Boundaries"
msgstr "解释边界"

#: ../../source/tutorials/h2-resource-estimation.rst:71
msgid ""
"Resource estimates describe an EFTQC algorithmic cost model. They do not predict local Catalyst "
"compile memory, host RAM usage, or wall-clock runtime for PennyLane simulation."
msgstr "资源估计描述 EFTQC 算法成本模型，不能预测本地 Catalyst 编译内存、主机内存用量或 PennyLane 模拟的实际运行时间。"
